{"unit_id":"AlLHHH__dsh-perf-boost#caveat-1","repo":"AlLHHH/dsh-perf-boost","commit":"67c46bd23086a64bb4a56b2f1d7b4a1bb019ec39","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-perf-boost 的设置页检查更新时，宿主会向 npm 镜像查询插件最新版本；网络请求只包含包名与 latest 路径。预热开关和近期性能记录会写入用户目录下的 ~/.dsh 文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:33-39","lib/index.js:95-123","lib/index.js:28-31","lib/index.js:135-142"]}
